C16 ~~ c(1, 1)*C16 + c(theta.10_10.g1, theta.10_10.g2)*C16

## LATENT MEANS/INTERCEPTS:

Risk ~ c(0, 0)*1 + c(alpha.1.g1, alpha.1.g2)*1
Coping ~ c(0, 0)*1 + c(alpha.2.g1, alpha.2.g2)*1
Confidence ~ c(0, 0)*1 + c(alpha.3.g1, alpha.3.g2)*1

## COMMON-FACTOR VARIANCES:

Risk ~~ c(1, 1)*Risk + c(psi.1_1.g1, psi.1_1.g2)*Risk
Coping ~~ c(1, 1)*Coping + c(psi.2_2.g1, psi.2_2.g2)*Coping
Confidence ~~ c(1, 1)*Confidence + c(psi.3_3.g1, psi.3_3.g2)*Confidence

## COMMON-FACTOR COVARIANCES:

Risk ~~ c(NA, NA)*Coping + c(psi.2_1.g1, psi.2_1.g2)*Coping
Risk ~~ c(NA, NA)*Confidence + c(psi.3_1.g1, psi.3_1.g2)*Confidence
Coping ~~ c(NA, NA)*Confidence + c(psi.3_2.g1, psi.3_2.g2)*Confidence

